WEBVTT

00:08.400 --> 00:10.200
What is it?

00:11.440 --> 00:13.680
Hugh is dead.

00:13.680 --> 00:16.980
I have no use for him anymore anyway.

00:16.980 --> 00:20.110
But Pronimo, the name of the
game here, was stolen.

00:22.080 --> 00:23.620
By whom?

00:23.620 --> 00:25.150
Beats me.

00:25.150 --> 00:26.350
Find it.

00:26.350 --> 00:27.980
Now!

00:30.060 --> 00:33.600
First you have me play watchdog,
and now you want me to find someone?

00:33.600 --> 00:35.890
You're such a slave-driver.

00:46.740 --> 00:48.710
Who was it?!

01:02.660 --> 01:10.270
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

01:10.270 --> 01:13.440
Utatte iru

01:13.440 --> 01:21.080
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

01:21.080 --> 01:24.350
Shimaikonde

01:24.350 --> 01:34.920
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:34.920 --> 01:40.360
Ayumou

01:40.360 --> 01:45.770
Susumou

01:45.770 --> 01:50.610
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:50.610 --> 01:56.080
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:56.080 --> 02:01.550
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

02:01.550 --> 02:06.790
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

02:06.790 --> 02:10.820
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

02:12.460 --> 02:15.990
Atashi wa ikite yuku

02:22.840 --> 02:26.530
Episode 40
Sought-After Power

02:42.590 --> 02:45.030
I must say, Master Robès,
I'm impressed as always!

02:45.030 --> 02:49.360
I hear you played a starring role
in that battle in Neotopia!

02:49.360 --> 02:50.700
Oh, yes!

02:50.700 --> 02:55.700
I wish I could have seen you and Belladonna
do your beautiful dance.

02:55.700 --> 02:59.510
Now, now, it's no cause for celebration.

02:59.510 --> 03:04.580
The only thing war ever leaves in its
wake is a feeling of emptiness.

03:04.580 --> 03:07.380
Oh, Master Robès!

03:08.780 --> 03:12.890
Well, today's party is a celebration
of our safe return.

03:12.890 --> 03:15.190
Please enjoy yourselves.

03:16.390 --> 03:19.360
We'll have to get through this month
on our line of credit too.

03:20.400 --> 03:22.690
I'm so glad you're safe.

03:43.220 --> 03:44.350
Morning!

03:44.350 --> 03:45.690
Morning!

03:45.690 --> 03:48.490
Mickey, Roya is here!

03:49.190 --> 03:50.630
Hi, Roya.

03:50.630 --> 03:52.730
Well, did you get a good night's sleep?

03:52.730 --> 03:54.700
Yep, slept like a log!

03:54.700 --> 03:56.460
Hey, where's Zed?

03:56.460 --> 03:58.200
He's not with you?

03:58.200 --> 04:00.640
I haven't seen him.

04:00.640 --> 04:04.940
Oh, I was so sure he'd be with you.

04:06.980 --> 04:08.600
Boss!

04:09.210 --> 04:11.250
Can I take some bread from here?

04:11.250 --> 04:13.010
Why?

04:13.010 --> 04:16.020
All my bread's sold out!

04:16.020 --> 04:17.320
Boss?

04:17.320 --> 04:19.520
We've sold out too; there's no more.

04:19.520 --> 04:21.290
You can close up shop for today.

04:21.290 --> 04:22.290
Got it!

04:22.290 --> 04:24.090
See you later, then!

04:25.090 --> 04:27.630
Say, what the heck's going on?

04:27.630 --> 04:31.830
Mickey's bread is really selling,
so he opened up a branch store!

04:31.830 --> 04:33.370
Branch store?!

04:33.370 --> 04:36.240
Pinot and Mia quit their jobs as maids,

04:36.240 --> 04:38.540
and now they're working for me!

04:38.540 --> 04:41.010
Wow!

04:41.010 --> 04:43.980
Maybe I've got a talent for business?

04:45.580 --> 04:47.380
Looks like it.

04:56.120 --> 04:59.360
Neotopia has fallen completely
into the hands of Tusk.

04:59.360 --> 05:04.370
We've lost our strongest ally,
and now we have no backing.

05:04.370 --> 05:06.230
Don't lose heart...

05:06.230 --> 05:09.400
Though I suppose it's no good saying that now.

05:09.400 --> 05:13.470
We'd like you to continue on as
one of Templar's sages,

05:13.470 --> 05:15.940
and work with us for peace.

05:16.910 --> 05:18.780
Very well.

05:18.780 --> 05:25.350
However, Templar is sure to be Tusk's next target.

05:25.350 --> 05:27.220
We can't remain inactive.

05:27.220 --> 05:31.860
We must gather as many shard casters
as we can, and fortify our defenses.

05:31.860 --> 05:36.200
But now Tusk counts even Zymot
among its vassal states.

05:36.200 --> 05:41.270
Can we really compete against an enemy
that outmatched Neotopia?

05:41.270 --> 05:42.670
With matters as they are,

05:42.670 --> 05:45.970
what would you say to joining forces with Ulvarx?

05:45.970 --> 05:49.740
We have no idea what Ulvarx is thinking!

05:49.740 --> 05:53.380
When it comes down to it,
they're a bunch of Neotopian exiles.

05:53.380 --> 05:56.010
Who knows if we can trust them?

06:30.020 --> 06:31.420
Noah...

06:31.420 --> 06:33.890
Where the heck did you disappear to?

06:39.390 --> 06:41.360
You've got a bite.

06:44.070 --> 06:45.690
Old man...

06:53.240 --> 06:56.210
Gazing at the water like this,

06:56.210 --> 07:00.950
makes what we went through in Neotopia
seem like a dream, doesn't it?

07:00.950 --> 07:04.910
Although if it was a dream,
it was definitely a nightmare.

07:06.390 --> 07:11.020
Zed, what did you feel in that war?

07:12.690 --> 07:15.160
I never want to be part of
something like that again.

07:16.060 --> 07:20.520
I didn't want to become strong so
I could fight a war like that.

07:21.140 --> 07:25.090
But eventually battle will break out again.

07:28.440 --> 07:34.820
We may need your power to stop this fighting.

07:34.820 --> 07:37.110
What do you mean?

07:52.070 --> 07:53.840
Where is Gitra?

07:53.840 --> 07:57.790
As usual, it seems he doesn't intend
to make an appearance.

07:58.610 --> 08:01.400
Honestly, that man is a problem.

08:03.210 --> 08:06.550
We've attained complete control over Neotopia.

08:06.550 --> 08:10.250
Eventually, the surviving citizens will
submit to our rule,

08:10.250 --> 08:12.690
and order will be restored.

08:12.690 --> 08:15.490
There's no such country as " Neotopia" anymore.

08:15.490 --> 08:18.030
That land is a part of Tusk.

08:18.030 --> 08:21.330
Expanding our territory is all well and good,

08:21.330 --> 08:24.270
but the point was the key spirits.

08:24.270 --> 08:26.390
Letting them slip away was a blunder.

08:28.440 --> 08:33.340
Yes, I hear that someone escaped
with both Hugh's key spirit

08:33.340 --> 08:36.410
and Monadi, the spirit that lay beneath Neotopia.

08:36.410 --> 08:41.870
Tusk's goal is to gather all the key spirits
and supervise them.

08:42.880 --> 08:44.750
Isn't that right?

08:44.750 --> 08:47.050
I have men in pursuit right now.

08:47.050 --> 08:49.420
We'll recover them without fail.

08:49.420 --> 08:51.890
And Sachura too, of course.

08:51.890 --> 08:53.860
I know.

08:54.300 --> 08:58.800
But before that, there's a territory
I'm concerned about.

08:58.800 --> 09:00.430
Ulvarx?

09:00.430 --> 09:02.060
Yes...

09:03.200 --> 09:06.510
Their technology is a threat.

09:06.510 --> 09:09.640
I'd like to bring it under Tusk's control.

09:09.640 --> 09:12.770
And if we can't have it, I'll just destroy it.

09:13.350 --> 09:15.220
I see...

09:15.220 --> 09:18.790
In that case, would you take me with you?

09:18.790 --> 09:20.790
Do what you want.

09:20.790 --> 09:22.420
Miguel!

09:22.820 --> 09:23.860
Yes, sir!

09:23.860 --> 09:24.890
We're mounting an expedition.

09:24.890 --> 09:26.030
Get ready!

09:26.030 --> 09:27.650
Yes, sir!

09:28.030 --> 09:30.030
Ulvarx...

09:30.030 --> 09:33.330
Ginga, looks like we'll meet again
after all this time.

09:37.370 --> 09:43.380
The key spirit that you possess has
the power to change this world.

09:43.380 --> 09:46.210
The power to change the world?

09:46.210 --> 09:48.680
Come to think of it, Noah said that too.

09:49.320 --> 09:51.350
I don't know all the details,

09:51.350 --> 09:54.260
but the story is that when all the
key spirits are gathered,

09:54.260 --> 09:58.210
this world will end.

09:58.760 --> 10:00.800
Tell me, old man.

10:00.800 --> 10:05.030
Just what will happen when all the
key spirits are gathered?

10:05.030 --> 10:08.070
Even I don't know for sure,

10:08.070 --> 10:11.870
but some say that Tusker will be reborn.

10:12.670 --> 10:14.300
Tusker?

10:14.980 --> 10:17.950
Apparently, his power created
everything in all the lands,

10:17.950 --> 10:22.850
and is capable of destroying it all too.

10:22.850 --> 10:26.390
Does Tusker really have that kind of power?

10:26.390 --> 10:28.790
I don't know,

10:28.790 --> 10:35.750
but many have frantically sought the
key shards because of that legend.

10:36.230 --> 10:43.700
If someone were to gather all the key spirits
and gain the power of Tusker,

10:43.700 --> 10:47.830
that person would be able to do
as he liked with this world.

10:48.240 --> 10:50.950
At least, that's the implication,

10:50.950 --> 10:52.740
but I wonder.

10:53.180 --> 10:57.640
Zed, you've been chosen by Amir Gaul.

10:58.350 --> 11:00.290
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say

11:00.290 --> 11:05.090
that your judgment will sway
the future of this world.

11:05.430 --> 11:08.400
Keep that firmly in mind.

11:08.860 --> 11:11.990
Me, sway this world?

11:22.910 --> 11:25.650
Neotopia has collapsed.

11:25.650 --> 11:27.080
Hyrum is dead,

11:27.080 --> 11:30.880
and our long-standing grudge is laid to rest.

11:31.350 --> 11:33.990
What now, Doctor?

11:33.990 --> 11:38.430
Now that Tusk has seen Ex Machina,
unfinished though it may have been,

11:38.430 --> 11:41.000
we'll probably be their text target.

11:41.000 --> 11:42.230
Yes...

11:42.230 --> 11:48.030
That's exactly why we'll need a stronger
system than ever before.

11:49.000 --> 11:53.540
The Ex Machina that Helic stole was unfinished,

11:53.540 --> 11:57.010
but I've finally perfected it,

11:57.010 --> 12:02.310
a system that will fuse with any spirit
and completely control it!

12:03.150 --> 12:04.950
For real?

12:12.190 --> 12:14.160
Kaon Squad, forward march!

12:16.660 --> 12:18.670
Destroy their shield!

12:18.670 --> 12:21.130
Focus all your attacks on one point!

12:21.540 --> 12:23.160
Now!

12:33.410 --> 12:39.050
With this power, we can protect Ulvarx
from the threat of Tusk.

12:39.590 --> 12:43.550
No, we may even be able to overthrow Tusk.

12:44.260 --> 12:46.390
Are you sure about that?

12:46.390 --> 12:47.760
What?

12:47.760 --> 12:52.700
Strong power is eventually overthrown
by even stronger power.

12:52.700 --> 12:55.830
I've seen more than enough of that.

12:57.070 --> 12:59.040
And I think you have too, Doctor.

13:01.740 --> 13:06.540
Doctor, is making a thing like that really right?

13:10.080 --> 13:11.590
We're under attack from Tusk.

13:11.590 --> 13:13.880
The main shield is breached!

13:14.260 --> 13:15.490
It can't be!

13:15.490 --> 13:18.290
You're telling me they broke through that shield?!

13:28.770 --> 13:30.400
Go!

13:34.180 --> 13:35.800
Damn it!

13:42.980 --> 13:44.780
Now, Kaon!

14:00.840 --> 14:03.630
Could this spirit be...

14:08.740 --> 14:11.880
So, it is you, Dukeham.

14:11.880 --> 14:15.010
It's been a long time, Ginga.

14:15.850 --> 14:20.620
How ridiculous your mechanical body is.

14:20.620 --> 14:22.420
Dukeham!

14:32.130 --> 14:33.760
Karen!

14:47.050 --> 14:50.820
Ginga, I'm happy to see that even though
your body's become a machine,

14:50.820 --> 14:53.090
your eyes are the same as I remember,

14:53.090 --> 14:55.060
filled with battle-lust!

15:10.040 --> 15:11.810
You've got a bite.

15:11.810 --> 15:13.430
Yeah...

15:17.080 --> 15:19.680
I saw Mickey; he's doing really good.

15:19.680 --> 15:22.020
Thick as thieves with Pinot as always.

15:22.020 --> 15:24.690
Oh, and his business is booming.

15:24.690 --> 15:27.250
People were actually calling him " Boss" !

15:27.250 --> 15:29.050
Our Mickey!

15:29.620 --> 15:31.590
I see...

15:47.170 --> 15:49.110
Zed...

15:49.110 --> 15:51.010
What?

15:51.010 --> 15:55.470
I wonder where Sagiri is right now?

15:56.980 --> 16:00.610
I thought she was in the Stupa then, but...

16:02.390 --> 16:04.490
I hope she's alive.

16:04.490 --> 16:06.120
Yeah...

16:07.760 --> 16:14.060
With that many people hurt,
my tiny little power just didn't cut it.

16:14.900 --> 16:19.530
What we really need is the power
to stop the fighting.

16:23.580 --> 16:29.710
We may need your power to stop this fighting.

16:30.750 --> 16:33.380
My power...

16:43.460 --> 16:45.260
I see...

16:45.700 --> 16:48.740
Your body may be different,

16:48.740 --> 16:50.340
but your strength is just like I remember it.

16:50.340 --> 16:52.310
You just shut up!

17:03.080 --> 17:04.710
Damn!

17:06.650 --> 17:07.920
We're moving on, pronto!

17:07.920 --> 17:09.550
Yes, sir!

17:15.800 --> 17:17.760
Damn Dukeham...

17:28.780 --> 17:31.450
I don't care how many defensive walls they have!

17:31.450 --> 17:33.240
Destroy them all!

17:34.920 --> 17:38.420
Even if you destroy my lab,

17:38.420 --> 17:41.050
I'll never hand over this system!

17:52.130 --> 17:53.770
Master Sebastian...

17:53.770 --> 17:55.500
Hey, you two!

17:55.500 --> 17:58.510
Do you know an Ulvarx man named Ginga?

17:58.510 --> 17:59.610
Ginga?

17:59.610 --> 18:01.110
Um, yes...

18:01.110 --> 18:04.750
He was just caught shifting here
without permission,

18:04.750 --> 18:07.650
and now he's asking to see you.

18:07.650 --> 18:09.450
Ginga is?

18:16.220 --> 18:17.960
I'm surprised.

18:17.960 --> 18:22.760
I didn't know healing shards could mend
wounds like this so quickly.

18:23.560 --> 18:25.930
Thanks, honey.

18:25.930 --> 18:27.900
You're welcome.

18:28.900 --> 18:32.810
So, is Ulvarx in Tusk hands now, or what?

18:32.810 --> 18:34.680
I don't know.

18:34.680 --> 18:39.480
It's pathetic, but I didn't have a
choice but to turn to you.

18:41.350 --> 18:44.980
Please, give me your help.

18:46.550 --> 18:50.560
Doctor Vendar's perfected a new system

18:50.560 --> 18:53.360
that fuses spirits together and controls them.

18:53.630 --> 18:57.760
If it falls into Tuskan hands,
Templar will be in danger too.

18:59.230 --> 19:02.200
Come with me to Ulvarx!

19:05.770 --> 19:07.010
Old man!

19:07.010 --> 19:10.640
Go to Ulvarx.

19:11.580 --> 19:13.210
Master Zico?

19:13.210 --> 19:18.490
If Tusk becomes even more powerful,
we will have no means of defense.

19:18.490 --> 19:21.920
We must not hand over Ulvarx's
technology to them.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.990
I'd go without you telling me.

19:23.990 --> 19:26.190
I owe this guy one.

19:26.190 --> 19:28.320
Master Zico, I want to go too.

19:30.100 --> 19:31.890
Very well.

19:33.270 --> 19:35.060
Thank you very much!

19:41.710 --> 19:45.380
Whether or not Zed can become the savior

19:45.380 --> 19:50.350
depends on his actions from now on.

19:50.350 --> 19:52.990
Will Roya be all right?

19:52.990 --> 19:56.990
She's already found her own path.

19:56.990 --> 20:00.790
I'm sure she'll be of aid to Zed.

20:03.460 --> 20:08.090
Both of you, come back to us safely.

20:10.770 --> 20:12.710
St..Stay away!

20:12.710 --> 20:15.680
I won't hand over this system to anyone!

20:15.680 --> 20:18.810
I'm impressed you've given us so much trouble,

20:18.810 --> 20:20.610
I'll give you that much.

20:21.450 --> 20:24.750
So, this is Ulvarx's technology, eh?

20:33.360 --> 20:35.660
This is Ulvarx?

20:37.730 --> 20:39.870
What a rotten place.

20:39.870 --> 20:44.910
Yeah, this was never someplace
people could really live.

20:44.910 --> 20:49.370
These living quarters were built
on the sacrifices of many.

20:49.740 --> 20:52.180
Where's the system Tusk is after?

20:52.180 --> 20:54.280
In the central laboratory.

20:54.280 --> 20:58.580
Its defensive system won't have
been easily defeated.

21:05.990 --> 21:08.160
What is this?

21:08.160 --> 21:09.330
How terrible...

21:09.330 --> 21:11.330
This place is in shambles inside.

21:11.330 --> 21:16.290
They may have gotten close to
the central lab by now.

21:24.280 --> 21:25.910
Doctor...

21:26.710 --> 21:28.450
Thank goodness.

21:28.450 --> 21:31.910
It looks like they haven't taken the lab yet.

21:34.860 --> 21:36.480
Doctor!

21:37.260 --> 21:39.660
So, you're safe, Doctor?!

21:39.660 --> 21:43.430
Oh, Ginga, you survived, then?

21:43.430 --> 21:45.530
Where are the Tuskans?

21:45.530 --> 21:47.130
Who are those two?

21:47.130 --> 21:49.570
Zed and Roya of Templar.

21:49.570 --> 21:52.640
Never mind that, where are the Tuskans?

21:52.640 --> 21:54.610
We're right here.

21:57.580 --> 21:59.200
Dukeham!

22:01.950 --> 22:05.250
I see, so you're Zed?

22:05.990 --> 22:07.990
Who the hell are you guys?

22:07.990 --> 22:11.450
I'm Dukeham, one of Tusk's highest officials.

22:11.930 --> 22:16.560
I'm honored to meet you, Zed.

22:18.730 --> 22:23.870
I can't wait to meet your Amir Gaul.

22:23.870 --> 22:25.500
What?!

22:27.970 --> 22:35.940
Dukeham...

22:39.620 --> 22:42.020
Wazurawashii toko kara hanarete
I just wanted to get away

22:42.020 --> 22:44.920
Wazurawashii toko kara hanarete
From that troublesome place

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
Habatakitakatta dake
And flap my wings

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
Mou kodomo ja nai no ni to
How many times have I scolded myself

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
Nando jibun o shikatta darou
For still being so immature?

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
Yakusoku sareta basho made
I'll just move with all I've got

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Hitasura susumu dake sa
Towards that promised place

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Bokura no tsubasa wa
Ours are true wings

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Honmono no totemo totemo kirei na hane dakara
Of very, very beautiful feathers

23:24.000 --> 23:26.700
Donna hageshii ooki na kaze ni mo makenai
So we won't succumb

23:26.700 --> 23:33.740
Donna hageshii ooki na kaze ni mo makenai
To even the greatest, most intense gust of wind

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
Tooku e tooku e hitasura tobun da
We must fly far, far away with all we've got

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
Hora mou kaze ni natte
See, now we're one with the wind

23:49.560 --> 23:54.630
Anna ni namida o koraeta hi mo waraeru kara
And we can look back and laugh at those days

23:54.630 --> 23:57.930
Anna ni namida o koraeta hi mo waraeru kara
We choked back so many tears

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
Sekai no hate made
All the way to the ends of the world

24:18.150 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
The Thought That Possessed Him

24:18.150 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "The Thought That Possessed Him"
